Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.37,0:00:05.49,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.26,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:14.63,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:25.35,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,We were able to escape from the set course
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:29.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,512)}Translation & initial syncing\N{\fs40}Vegapunk Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.90,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,along the boundary between sky and sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.15,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now we're rowing our way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:34.53,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,462)}Syncing\N{\fs40}Galaxy 9000\N\N{\fs}Sync-checking\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:40.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,to a hidden adventure at the dark bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:40.74,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294,372)}Quality checking\N{\fs40}Sewil and Galaxy 9000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:47.46,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it sound fun just thinking about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.91,0:00:44.12,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,480)}{\fad(50,0)}Video editing\N{\fs40}Sewil
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:47.46,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760,540)}Soundtracking\N{\fs40}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:51.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's travel all through the worldwide seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:54.22,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,raising our battle cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:58.55,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you've made up your mind, let the signal for departure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.97,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:11.57,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:15.07,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.86,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.53,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:26.79,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:33.71,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:38.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:40.43,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:44.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:47.45,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:04.66,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.79,0:02:07.00,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:11.33,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:13.67,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:17.84,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.01,0:02:20.18,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.54,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:36.92,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(640,100)\fad(2000,2000)}已經很消極了！\N騙人布的勇敢奮戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:39.70,Captions,,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,320)\fad(170,0)}Thriller Bark內部：桅杆大宅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.70,Captions small,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(164,100)}{}莫利亞的舞廳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.70,Captions small,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(114,210)}{}培羅娜的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.70,0:02:41.33,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,騙人布和香吉士掉到下面去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.33,0:02:43.41,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們就這樣丟下他們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:44.30,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,對！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.70,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他們會沒事的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.99,0:02:49.02,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,總之，我們得趁莫利亞還沒移動前找到他。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.47,0:02:52.13,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,一找到那根巨大蔥頭我就狠狠揍他！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.40,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.82,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那是解決一切麻煩最快的方法。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:03:00.15,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那就是舞廳的入口，魯夫的影子就是在那裡被帶走的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:04.85,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們最後是在更裡面的冷凍庫看到莫利亞的。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.17,0:03:06.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:14.91,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.91,0:03:16.80,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你打敗培羅娜了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:20.09,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,霍古巴克！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.47,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,這隻馴鹿是怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:26.18,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,那是霍古巴克醫生嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.59,0:03:29.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他就是跟莫利亞在一起的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.85,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,要不要我順便揍這傢伙？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.21,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,等…等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.68,0:03:34.69,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,等等，魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:38.54,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,這傢伙交給我怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.07,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那邊就是門口，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.18,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那是冷凍庫。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:44.37,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,先走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.07,0:03:46.62,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:50.31,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,太沒禮貌了，不打招呼就要去見莫利亞大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:52.88,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,辛德莉小姐！上！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:53.54,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.24,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,一！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:56.56,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,二！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:58.07,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！盤子？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:01.09,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,三——
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.14,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,辛德莉小姐，你怎麼了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.53,0:04:07.60,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,先走吧，魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:09.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,謝了，羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.14,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,等等，草帽！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:12.39,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,霍古巴克！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:17.98,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我對你太失望了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.98,0:04:19.98,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我不承認你是醫生！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:25.90,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我都認不出你了，喬巴醫生！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.46,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,原來你一直都是動物系能力者…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.46,0:04:31.70,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,難怪我覺得你是個奇怪的生物。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:36.96,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎麼避開被送到培羅娜花園的，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:40.97,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,這次你跑不掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.97,0:04:42.46,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我要奪走你的影子！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:46.24,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:47.59,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,更好的辦法是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:51.56,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,把你在這裡殺了，把你變成傀儡怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.45,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,他們會動手的。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:05:00.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這條通道長得不可思議！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.09,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,好！出去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.84,0:05:05.82,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這是什麼地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.95,0:05:12.04,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,找到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.39,0:05:13.97,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,喲！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:15.33,Main,Moriah,0,0,0,,只有你啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:29.85,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是什麼巨大的東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:32.88,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是什麼大魔王嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:35.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我從沒見過這樣的巨人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:37.39,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是殭屍嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.58,0:05:39.56,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:40.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,魯夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:41.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一切都完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他來殺我們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他想做什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.87,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,這個看起來不錯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:21.81,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,好！現在一切就緒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:26.40,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,我一定會成為海賊王！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:30.39,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,剛才建築倒塌的時候還挺驚訝的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:32.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什…什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:35.99,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他根本沒注意到我們？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:40.25,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那東西說話真的很像魯夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:45.05,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,魯夫的力量放進那樣的身體裡確實很危險。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.98,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們就…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:50.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,忘了影子的事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:52.05,Main,Both,0,0,0,,當然不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:56.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,就算放棄影子，我們還沒救出娜美小姐呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.80,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,振作點！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.90,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，怎麼通過這裡才是問題…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:06.82,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,看來我和騙人布跟著樓梯一起掉下來了，但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:09.57,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,就算想改變路線…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:15.06,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這座橋已經塌了，我們再也去不了那個像桅杆的大宅了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:17.74,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,跳也不是辦法…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:22.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們的捷徑變成了一條殭屍出沒的繞路…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.40,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,再撐三十秒！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:29.38,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我不確定這個裝飾好不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.63,Main,All,0,0,0,,他搭了一座橋！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:36.97,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這些碎石和木材搭個一兩座橋綽綽有餘。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:41.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不過明明是緊急情況，你做得還真精細。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.81,0:07:44.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你指望我做出偷工減料的東西嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.65,0:07:46.82,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不，這就很好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.45,0:07:49.31,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,總之，多虧了你。走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.25,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這個房間怎麼回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:06.25,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,挺引人注目的房間。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.76,0:08:16.80,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我本來打算讓樓梯和橋上的殭屍把你們當獵物的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.97,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,沒想到奧茲會掉下來。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:22.81,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,真是個多管閒事的傢伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:27.48,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那些幽靈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:30.94,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,是她在操控嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.57,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,她到底是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:41.12,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,到現在你們應該知道這些幽靈有多可怕了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:46.46,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,拜虛空果實所賜，我是能夠隨意製造幽靈的幽靈女！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:49.79,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,這些幽靈是我自身的分支。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:52.42,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,它們會掏空人的心靈。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:57.16,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你們到此為止了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:09:02.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒想到那些麻煩的幽靈竟然是那個可愛女孩在操控！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:04.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在不是說這個的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:07.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果被那些東西碰到，我們就真的完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:08.86,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,只能逃跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:11.34,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,它們確實很危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:13.49,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}消極幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:28.13,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我的存在還不如一隻蛆蟲…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:29.40,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你說得對…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:33.42,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,真希望我生為一隻流浪狗…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:39.39,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我不配跟你們走在同一片大地上…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.71,0:09:43.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,一切…都結束了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:46.72,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,把他們抓起來。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.78,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,真簡單。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:54.53,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,只剩上面的了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:56.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,暴動射擊：鹽彈星！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:01.53,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.71,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我不會讓你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:11.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,碰我的夥伴一根手指！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:13.36,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:15.67,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,原來他在裝中招？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:17.27,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,消極幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:29.14,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:32.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我的名字是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.21,0:10:35.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,騙人布船長。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.36,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,為什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.40,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,為什麼對你沒有效果？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.40,0:10:40.86,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,幽靈穿過你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:43.62,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你用了什麼把戲？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:46.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這不是把戲…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:48.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我從以前就一直…！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:51.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,很消極！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:59.99,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他對幽靈的消極力量免疫！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:01.72,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,太不可思議的男人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.73,Thoughts,Perona,0,0,0,,不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:15.19,Thoughts,Perona,0,0,0,,不可能存在對消極幽靈免疫的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:18.46,Thoughts,Perona,0,0,0,,人們執著於生命。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:22.74,Thoughts,Perona,0,0,0,,正因為如此他們才能不斷前進，然而…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.91,Thoughts,Perona,0,0,0,,然而…這個男人…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:29.27,Main,All,0,0,0,,{\i1}加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:31.25,Main,Note,0,0,0,,{\move(246,106,698,432,8,1093)}加油啊！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:31.25,Main,Note,0,0,0,,{\move(1074,128,1078,486,6,1674)}戰鬥！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.18,Main,Note,0,0,0,,{\move(56,494,440,567,8,1051)}活下去！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在別幫我加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.25,Secondary,All,0,0,0,,{\i1}加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:35.35,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好了，快振作起來吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:37.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們趕快去救娜美和布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:39.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你不能…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:43.51,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,以你那不足的能力，別指望能打贏她。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:46.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:49.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,這種可靠的感覺是什麼…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:52.14,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他沒有受到影響…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:53.52,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:57.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但是…你要對付她周圍的殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,老天知道我打不贏他們！我肯定會死——
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.43,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,全都交給你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:02.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,什麼？啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.15,0:12:02.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不——！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.40,0:12:02.70,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不是那——！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:03.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一——！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.63,0:12:04.50,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我不是——！我是——！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.21,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.85,0:12:08.21,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:16.33,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,新郎阿布薩羅姆…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:23.97,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,你願意娶娜美為妻，無論疾病或健康，愛她珍惜她，直到死亡將你們分開嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:26.99,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我願意！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.69,0:12:32.68,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,新娘娜美…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:38.44,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,你願意永遠愛阿布薩羅姆嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:41.11,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是的！我願意！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.36,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,我真的好愛阿布大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.58,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,現在你可以親吻新娘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:04.05,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,怎麼看都不可能吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:09.93,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,用這次同時攻擊，你的求生意志將會徹底消失！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.16,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,四重消極攻擊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:16.52,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,消極幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:22.32,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:24.28,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,四個完全穿過他了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.55,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,自從Thriller Bark建立以來…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:33.27,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,從來沒有人能對幽靈的消極力量免——
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:37.22,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,消極幽靈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:39.71,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,變消極了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.79,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,庫瑪西，一直以來對不起你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:45.09,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,連培羅娜大人都被影響了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:48.16,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,那個傢伙是聖人嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:49.64,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,他是聖人吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.74,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你們都給我聽好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:56.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,說到消極思考…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.76,0:13:59.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒有人能超越我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:03.07,Main,Wild Zombie,0,0,0,,對這麼沒用的事情充滿自信！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:06.84,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,210)\fad(280,0)}培羅娜的奇幻花園
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:06.84,Main,Zoro,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(640,100)}誰想得到騙人布的消極個性在這種地方能派上用場。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.84,0:14:11.43,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果他不在的話，我們現在已經死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:14.77,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他的能力真是可怕。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:18.48,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我把你留在這裡，我去娜美小姐那邊了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.48,0:14:19.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.84,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,全力以赴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.84,0:14:22.19,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,當然！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:24.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我是愛情的鬼火！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:27.47,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美～！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:31.45,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你不會成為別人的新娘的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:33.12,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他跳下去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:35.65,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他知道這裡有多高嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:36.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.32,0:14:39.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,越是熱血沸騰，就越感覺不到疼痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:42.33,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,總之，我們往那棟大宅的最高層前進！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.33,0:14:43.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:45.05,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那個骷髏一定在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:06.63,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,就像鳳凰一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:08.76,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,不對，更像是殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.92,0:15:13.12,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,你應該已經站不起來了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:19.09,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,是時候永遠封住你的行動了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.09,0:15:23.60,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,讓你再也不會出現來要回你的影子。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:28.99,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,要不要我用那招特別的「燕口斬」送你上路？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:32.80,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你什麼都不懂。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.72,0:15:35.53,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不准用那個名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:40.71,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那個快速斬擊技的名字…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:44.39,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,來自我故國的奇襲部隊，叫做…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:47.48,Note,Brook,0,0,200,,安魂曲：葬禮上演唱的歌曲類型\N旗幟斬：水平擊劍攻擊或旗幟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.39,0:15:47.48,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,安魂旗幟斬。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.48,0:15:54.30,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,而我的同伴們給這個備受讚譽的劍技起的別名是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:57.49,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,三步必殺：燕口斬！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.49,0:16:03.85,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,雖然你有我的性格和技術，但你已經失去了我的記憶和人性。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:05.98,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,所以你沒有資格使用那個名字！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:10.65,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,如果你暗示你才是真正的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.65,0:16:13.91,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,那就試著超越我這冒牌的劍技吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:18.44,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,這是你最後的機會…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.73,Main,Both,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三步必殺…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.92,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}燕口斬！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:02.70,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,拉布！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:08.46,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,我最想向你道歉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:13.24,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,在這片黑暗的海域已經漫長的五十年了…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.15,0:17:17.05,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,然而…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.56,0:17:20.26,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,活著也毫無意義…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:23.39,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,好孤獨…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:25.39,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,我的人生…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:30.96,Thoughts,Brook,0,0,0,,好孤獨…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:38.68,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,首先…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:41.62,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,當然要先把那個爆炸頭弄掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:52.38,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:54.03,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,大宅在搖晃…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:56.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！這搖晃是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:58.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,誰知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:17:59.03,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,也許是地震？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:04.47,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這裡是實驗室嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:06.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.81,0:18:08.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂！骷髏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:12.11,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你被打得很慘啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:13.48,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你還在這個世上嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.06,0:18:15.59,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你還活著嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.34,Main,Brooke,0,0,0,,你…你們…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:18.45,Main,Brooke,0,0,0,,為什麼會在這裡…？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:23.76,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,真可悲…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.70,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,打完敗者之後來可憐他！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.22,0:18:29.46,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.49,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:35.67,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,傳說中很久以前斬過龍的那位武士嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:39.67,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我一直想見你。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,親一個！親一個！親一個！親一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:47.33,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,喂！等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:48.89,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,這搖晃是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.21,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我沒辦法親吻我的新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.03,0:18:52.11,Main,Zombie General,0,0,0,,阿布薩羅姆大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:53.25,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:54.63,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,你發現什麼了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:59.28,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,這艘巨船Thriller Bark正在被一股奇怪的海流吸進去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.28,0:19:01.72,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,整座島都在搖！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:04.79,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.79,0:19:09.47,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,似乎是…特殊殭屍在亂動舵。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:10.58,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:13.00,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,在動！在動了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:14.14,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,將軍殭屍們！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.14,0:19:16.41,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,立刻出動！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.41,0:19:18.09,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,阻止奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:18.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.39,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:31.57,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,到此為止了，特殊殭屍奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.00,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,從他的腿開始砍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:38.82,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,奧茲在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.61,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,他不見了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.94,0:19:43.12,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,這麼巨大…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.28,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,怎麼能動得這麼快？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:49.89,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:50.46,Main,Zombie general,0,0,0,,上面！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.39,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.39,0:19:56.71,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}（雖然我不是橡膠…）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.37,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}機關槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.53,0:20:14.15,Main,Oars,0,0,0,,別妨礙我的冒險！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.78,0:20:21.20,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,被殲滅了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.66,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,從這裡過去的那些？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.66,0:20:25.26,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是…是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:27.16,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,所有人都被壓碎了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.16,0:20:30.77,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,他們可是這座島最強的殭屍軍隊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:32.52,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,他們是將軍殭屍啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:34.35,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,是的，在一眨眼的功夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:36.94,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,不可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.33,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,奧茲不是應該是我們的同伴嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:41.55,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,為什麼他在胡亂暴走？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:45.01,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,殭屍應該只會服從命令才對。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.01,0:20:47.70,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,如果依靠那種傢伙，
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.70,0:20:50.89,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark會變成什麼樣都不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.73,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:01.73,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我來救你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:05.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,她在那裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.57,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,草帽一夥的…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.67,0:21:23.84,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,好厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:26.73,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他把龍馬推開了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:28.14,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他是誰…？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:32.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,只是一個使用三刀流的野性海賊劍士。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.14,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他相當強。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:40.68,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,如果你的自尊允許的話，他可以替你奪回你的影子…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:41.76,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你覺得怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:42.90,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我的影子…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:44.13,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,真的嗎…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:48.70,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,拜託你…請…請拿回我的影——
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:50.60,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,閉嘴！安靜點！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:55.25,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，骷髏！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:57.35,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.35,0:21:59.79,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那是一把好刀啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.83,0:22:03.75,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,好眼力…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:07.63,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,這確實是二十一工大快刀之一…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:11.10,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,帶有亂刃紋的黑刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:14.01,Note,Note,0,0,100,,秋水：秋天之水
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:14.01,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,妖刀…名刀秋水。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.01,0:22:17.60,Main,Ryuma,0,0,0,,一眼就能認出的寶物。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:20.23,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,大快刀嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.23,0:22:23.25,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,能遇到這種好東西真是榮幸。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.25,0:22:27.61,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,不愧是自稱武士的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:34.60,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那把刀我正好用得上。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.68,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你太帥了！
Comment: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:47.46,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760,270)}Title card artist\N{\fs40}
